WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440
The respiratory act comprises four phases. Therefore, first we learn to...

2
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.970
I am conscious of my respiration, and then I am conscious of following my respiration.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.300
First, you bring mindfulness to the respiration.

4
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.550
Within mindfulness, there is also an energy we call concentration.

5
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.080
Because automatically, I must remain attentive for a longer duration.

6
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:35.400
Attempt to perceive this. Scientific research indicates that by working at this level, you develop empathic faculties, compassion, and attention,

7
00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:52.691
far more subtle, which lead to a state of well-being. What I refer to as joy, when one learns to remain focused on their respiration, when one learns to follow their respiration, subsequently, one learns to recognize the body, uniting body and mind,

8
00:00:52.691 --> 00:00:56.581
and then, at the fourth level, one learns to release the body.

9
00:00:56.581 --> 00:01:04.741
Once this is accomplished, we delve into the essence. The fifth level is to generate a feeling of joy, which is said to originate from the teachings

10
00:01:04.741 --> 00:01:15.141
of the Buddha, who stated, 'I will teach you 16 ways to engender respiration.' And then, we will perform an exercise that focuses more on the expiratory act,

11
00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:18.091
which is called 'Brah-mari,' the bee's breath.

12
00:01:18.091 --> 00:01:25.201
This has a very interesting faculty on the brain, rapidly inducing a calm state of the mind and a reduction in stress.

13
00:01:25.201 --> 00:01:30.241
The tongue is the bud of the heart, and the thyroid originates from the tongue.

14
00:01:30.241 --> 00:01:38.131
One speaks with their heart, in fact, but with the frequential, almost energetic, subtlety, one might say, of the thyroid.

15
00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:45.651
This implies that at a certain point, it is no longer the word itself, but the sound. It is the frequency you engage with.

16
00:01:45.651 --> 00:01:55.251
I will guide you; we will perform the first five steps, then we will do the Brah-mari, and then we will release and simply observe a kind of silence within the body.

17
00:01:55.251 --> 00:01:59.381
One will need to produce a sound originating from the posterior pharynx.

18
00:01:59.381 --> 00:02:06.921
Like a bee or a bumblebee ascending, and this sound must rise into the cavity to culminate at the level of the sinuses.

19
00:02:06.921 --> 00:02:13.121
We will assess the entire cerebral region, extending into the tympanic cavity and sinus cavity.

20
00:02:13.121 --> 00:02:19.481
Frontal, sphenoidal, maxillary, and even temporal. We will first adopt an upright posture.

21
00:02:19.481 --> 00:02:27.081
When I straighten my back, upon exhalation, I will experience the true physiological effect of a release on my vagal tone.

22
00:02:27.081 --> 00:02:35.321
this parasympathetic and restorative system. If I position myself thus, and restrict here, I diminish this capacity.

23
00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:38.511
I experience this state of inspiratory awareness.

24
00:02:38.511 --> 00:02:43.391
Second level, I am very, very attentive to the act of respiration.

25
00:02:43.391 --> 00:02:49.461
I am aware of the body's movement during the respiratory act. Fourth level, I relax.

26
00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:55.971
upon exhalation, fully conscious that I am inhaling. We will perform twelve respirations.

27
00:02:55.971 --> 00:03:04.291
the first two we will perform thus, and the last ten we will perform with the ears slightly occluded; you will place your fingers over your ears

28
00:03:04.291 --> 00:03:12.251
to facilitate internal integration; you inhale, and during the expiratory phase, you produce a gentle humming sound.

29
00:03:13.066 --> 00:03:18.926
we inhale, occlude the ears, and you perform this ten times, and then you may release; you

30
00:03:22.677 --> 00:03:32.437
enter into the emerging silence, and within this silence, you simply allow a feeling of joy to arise, and if you are unsure what to do, offer a small

31
00:03:34.837 --> 00:03:44.117
smile; take another inhalation, perform an exhalation, and at the conclusion of the exhalation, There is a space where you do not respire.

32
00:03:48.528 --> 00:03:51.458
But you settle your consciousness within this space.

33
00:03:52.848 --> 00:03:56.578
Even as you reinspire, you remain within this space.

34
00:03:56.868 --> 00:04:01.578
When you enter this perception, you bring yourself closer to the embryonic breath.

35
00:04:05.368 --> 00:04:09.658
Because the embryonic breath was not subject to diaphragmatic movements.

36
00:04:10.228 --> 00:04:17.748
And if you do so, you will begin to perceive your heart, which was there eight months and nine days before your thoracic respiration.

37
00:04:23.799 --> 00:04:28.009
In other words, your heart begins to beat after 21 days.

38
00:04:29.319 --> 00:04:37.479
And so it is good to place oneself, from time to time, in this silence, because it is in silence that reorganization can occur.

39
00:04:37.479 --> 00:04:51.079
This embryonic force is always present, but to enter into this presence, this contact, you must accept to go into silence. You might rediscover a healing movement. Or that health can express itself, flourish more

40
00:04:51.079 --> 00:04:57.659
easily. You place it in this silence and allow space to open. Thus, a need for space.

41
00:04:57.659 --> 00:05:02.059
If there is no space, there is no development. Therefore, both this

42
00:05:02.059 --> 00:05:09.899
spacious silence are required. But if you restore to the tissue this capacity to rediscover this moment of silence,

43
00:05:10.341 --> 00:05:17.791
the body knows very well how it should reorganize itself because there it can utilize its potential upon which it was created.

44
00:05:17.791 --> 00:05:27.181
Therefore, I restore the possibility to the system that it knows, but it is so occupied that it no longer knows. I restore this vital principle.

45
00:05:27.721 --> 00:05:29.881
je redonne ce principe vital

